OL,3,ARussia frees US citizen Stephen
OL,4,AHubbard, state media reports
OL,5,
OL,6,FPresident Vladimir Putin says Russia
OL,7,Fhas agreed to release an American
OL,8,Fcitizen who was jailed for allegedly
OL,9,Ffighting on behalf of Ukraine, state
OL,10,Fmedia is reporting.
OL,12,FStephen Hubbard has been taken to
OL,13,FPulkovo Airport, Putin said, during
OL,14,Ftalks with US envoy Steve Witkoff in St
OL,15,FPetersburg.
OL,17,FHubbard, originally from Michigan, was
OL,18,F72 when he was sentenced to almost
OL,19,Fseven years in a penal colony in 2024.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
